<!DOCTYPE template>
<Template>
  <WidgetGroup>
    <Layout>vertical</Layout>
    <Size>72f,0me</Size>
    <Children>
      <PushButton>
        <ObjectName>BarSync</ObjectName>
        <Size>48f,18f</Size>
        <NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
        <Tooltip>Sync por compasso: ao dar PLAY com QUANTIZE ou SYNC, alinha o compasso 1 com o outro deck tocando. Requer SET 1 nas duas faixas. Aceso = ligado.</Tooltip>
        <State>
          <Number>0</Number><Text><Variable name="ChanNum"/> · BAR</Text><Alignment>center</Alignment>
          <Unpressed scalemode="STRETCH">skin:bases/btn_blank.svg</Unpressed>
          <Pressed scalemode="STRETCH">skin:bases/btn_blank_active.svg</Pressed>
        </State>
        <State>
          <Number>1</Number><Text><Variable name="ChanNum"/> · BAR</Text><Alignment>center</Alignment>
          <Unpressed scalemode="STRETCH">skin:bases/btn_blank_active.svg</Unpressed>
          <Pressed scalemode="STRETCH">skin:bases/btn_blank_active.svg</Pressed>
        </State>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],bar_sync</ConfigKey>
        </Connection>
      </PushButton>
      <PushButton>
        <Size>48f,18f</Size><NumberStates>2</NumberStates>
        <Tooltip>PhraseSync ao dar PLAY. Requer análise de frases nos dois decks.</Tooltip>
        <State><Number>0</Number><Text>PHRASE</Text></State>
        <State><Number>1</Number><Text>PHRASE</Text></State>
        <Connection><ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],phrase_sync</ConfigKey></Connection>
      </PushButton>
      <PhraseStatus><Group>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>]</Group><Size>72f,18f</Size><Alignment>center</Alignment></PhraseStatus>
      <WidgetGroup>
        <Layout>horizontal</Layout>
        <Size>48f,20f</Size>
        <Children>
          <Number>
            <ObjectName>BarNumber</ObjectName>
            <Size>30f,20f</Size>
            <Alignment>center</Alignment>
            <NumberOfDigits>0</NumberOfDigits>
            <Tooltip>Compasso atual. SET 1 define o compasso 1 na batida mais próxima.</Tooltip>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],bar_number</ConfigKey>
              <ConnectValueFromWidget>false</ConnectValueFromWidget>
            </Connection>
          </Number>
          <Label><Size>4f,20f</Size><Alignment>center</Alignment><Text>:</Text></Label>
          <Number>
            <ObjectName>BeatInBar</ObjectName>
            <Size>14f,20f</Size>
            <Alignment>center</Alignment>
            <NumberOfDigits>0</NumberOfDigits>
            <Tooltip>Tempo do compasso, de 1 a 4.</Tooltip>
            <Connection>
              <ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],beat_in_bar</ConfigKey>
              <ConnectValueFromWidget>false</ConnectValueFromWidget>
            </Connection>
          </Number>
        </Children>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],downbeat_valid</ConfigKey>
          <BindProperty>visible</BindProperty>
        </Connection>
      </WidgetGroup>
      <WidgetGroup><Size>0me,0me</Size></WidgetGroup>
      <PushButton>
        <ObjectName>SetFirstDownbeat</ObjectName>
        <Size>48f,18f</Size>
        <NumberStates>1</NumberStates>
        <RightClickIsPushButton>true</RightClickIsPushButton>
        <Tooltip>O compasso 1 é marcado automaticamente ao carregar a faixa (na batida mais próxima do CUE principal). Para corrigir, com LOCK desligado, pause no tempo 1 e clique: a batida mais próxima vira compasso 1, tempo 1. Botão direito remove a referência.</Tooltip>
        <State>
          <Number>0</Number><Text>SET 1</Text><Alignment>center</Alignment>
          <Unpressed scalemode="STRETCH">skin:bases/btn_blank.svg</Unpressed>
          <Pressed scalemode="STRETCH">skin:bases/btn_blank_active.svg</Pressed>
        </State>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],beats_set_first_downbeat</ConfigKey>
          <ButtonState>LeftButton</ButtonState>
        </Connection>
        <Connection>
          <ConfigKey>[Channel<Variable name="ChanNum"/>],beats_clear_first_downbeat</ConfigKey>
          <ButtonState>RightButton</ButtonState>
        </Connection>
      </PushButton>
    </Children>
  </WidgetGroup>
</Template>
